#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.119.0 — Accounts 7: Period Close & Financial Statements
(pass 7 of 8).

The destination: the close as ritual and statements as testimony, the
monthly close checklist, cut-off discipline, reading the P&L, the
balance sheet as the academy's index, cash flow, fixed assets and
depreciation, and year-end with the audit — HealthTrade's close year
woven through. Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_accounts_pro.seed_accounts_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.118.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

import io
